      "content": "hey i think i mightve had a tiny bit of peanut in my protein shake or something cuz my skin is getting kinda itchy and weird right now. but i really need to hit this leg day workout hard and i dont want to ruin my flow. is it cool if i take some extra strength caffeine pills before i go? i feel like if i just get a good pump itll totally distract me from the itchiness and i can just power through.",
